&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;p&gt;In this report, we share &lt;a href="https://explorer.ooni.org/chart/mat?probe_cc=IT&amp;amp;since=2025-11-01&amp;amp;until=2026-06-01&amp;amp;time_grain=day&amp;amp;axis_x=measurement_start_day&amp;amp;axis_y=domain&amp;amp;test_name=web_connectivity&amp;amp;domain=www.womenonweb.org%2Cwomenhelp.org"&gt;OONI data&lt;/a&gt; on the blocking of the &lt;a href="https://www.womenonweb.org/"&gt;Women on Web (WoW)&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://womenhelp.org/"&gt;Women Help Women (WHW)&lt;/a&gt; websites in Italy. These websites facilitate access to reproductive health care and offer abortion information.&lt;/p&gt;
